# IMPORTANT DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

Do not make every page look identical.

Create a **shared design language**, but allow every page to have its own information architecture.

For example:

* Dashboard → data visualization and overview
* Products → dense data management
* Orders → operational workflow
* Order Detail → information hierarchy
* Customers → profile + activity
* Analytics → data exploration
* Settings → structured forms
* Editors → focused content editing
* Catalog pages → tables + filters
* Detail pages → two-column information layouts

The system must be consistent without becoming repetitive.

