# FINAL DESIGN STANDARD

The finished application should not look like:

> "An existing dashboard with a new color palette."

It should look like:

> "A completely redesigned premium product that happens to use the same underlying application logic."

Prioritize:

**Hierarchy → Usability → Consistency → Data Visualization → Motion → Detail**

Every visual decision must have a purpose.

Every animation must have a reason.

Every chart must communicate information.

Every component must belong to the same design system.

Every page must feel intentionally designed.

Do not stop at making the application technically correct.

Make it feel **finished**.
